   Consider a finite-product-preserving adjunction between cartesian closed categories:
\begin{center}
\begin{tikzcd}[column sep=large]
\cV \arrow[r, bend left=20, "F"] \arrow[r, phantom, "\bot"] & \cW \arrow[l, bend left=20, "U"]   \end{tikzcd}
