Then change of base along the right adjoint respects the underlying categories:
\begin{center}
\begin{tikzcd}[sep=1.5 em] {\cW}\text{-}\mathcal{C}at \arrow[rr, "U_*"] \arrow[dr, "{(-)_0}"'] & & {\cV}\text{-}\mathcal{C}at \arrow[dl, "(-)_0"] \\ & \mathcal{C}at
